<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to expand 2-yr Bonte T-bond by $500 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina to expand 2-yr Bonte T-bond by $500 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's government will auction another $500 million of its two-year Bonte Treasury bond, first issued in December, on Feb 18, the Economy Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>The new auction will bring the total to $1 billion.</p>
<p>The Bontes mature on Dec 13, 1998, and will be sold through Dutch-style auction. Offers are due by 1400 local/1700 GMT on auction day.</p>
<p>Settlement is due on Feb 21.</p>
<p>((--Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
